CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The usual ACME service providers are notoriously picky about authenticat‐
     ing rules, and yield fairly long time-outs after just a few invalid at‐
     tempts.  It is strongly suggested to first validate a configuration with
     a staging server before moving an official certificate validation work‐
     flow to crontab(5) status.

